<blockquote>
<p>what happens if she creates a word going backwards?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The order in which a word is spelled doesn't matter. If you spell &quot;CAT&quot; from right to left, as long as the end result is &quot;CAT&quot; and not &quot;TAC,&quot; you'll still get the same results.</p>
<blockquote>
