														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4509196">
									

<p>Nouns are not necessarily physical objects with concrete referents. Nouns can refer to abstract concepts, like 'concept', 'word', 'language', or 'noun'.</p>
<p>Did you know that there are words that form other words when you invert them? Can she create a spinning TOP, or will she only get a POT?</p>
<p>or will she get marijuana?</p>
<p>When you have an SCP that involves natural language parsing, these are the sorts of questions that you should be thinking of. If you don't, someone else will.</p>

